version 19
clear all
set more off

* Working directory must be replication_v3.2.0_llm_peer/code/
* If invoked from a different cwd, set $repl_root before `do 00_master.do`.
if "$repl_root" == "" {
    global repl_root ".."  // assume cwd = code/
}
global data_dir   "$repl_root/data"
global out_dir    "$repl_root/output"
global tables_dir "$out_dir/tables"
global figures_dir "$out_dir/figures"
capture mkdir "$out_dir"
capture mkdir "$tables_dir"
capture mkdir "$figures_dir"

* ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
* 1. Data prep — load panel, xtset, define $controls
* ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
* fix(omni-g-replication-01, 2026-06-11): 01_data_prep 失败时 fail-loud 带可读原因
* (常见原因: 外部财务列未接入 — ROA/CAR/ln_assets 族, 见 config/银行面板2007-2025年.xlsx
* 接入计划与 paper_spec.yaml enrichment_source), 而非裸 r(198) 中断。
capture noisily do 01_data_prep.do
local _prep_rc = _rc
if `_prep_rc' {
    display as error "[FATAL] 01_data_prep.do failed (rc=`_prep_rc') — 复现包中止; 详见上方 [ERROR] 行 (多为外部财务数据未接入)"
    exit `_prep_rc'
}

